  "notes": "{軍|ぐん} refers to military forces.\n\nCOMPOUND WORDS:\n- {軍|ぐん}{隊|たい} (army, troops)\n- {軍|ぐん}{人|じん} (military personnel)\n- {軍|ぐん}{事|じ} (military affairs)\n- {軍|ぐん}{備|び} (armaments)\n\nTYPES OF FORCES:\n- {陸|りく}{軍|ぐん} (army)\n- {海|かい}{軍|ぐん} (navy)\n- {空|くう}{軍|ぐん} (air force)\n\nAS SUFFIX:\n- {日本|にほん}{軍|ぐん} (Japanese military)\n- {米|べい}{軍|ぐん} (US military)\n- {敵|てき}{軍|ぐん} (enemy forces)\n- {味方|みかた}{軍|ぐん} (allied forces)",
